  "text": "#### [DeepSeek V4.1 Flash 1017](https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=Mzk0OTYwNzc3NQ==&mid=2247485876&idx=1&sn=2606d3fa9ac085f94290ddd1d94649cc)\n\n<aside class=\"info-card\">\n<p class=\"info-card-label\"><svg class=\"info-card-icon\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M8 6h13\"></path><path d=\"M8 12h13\"></path><path d=\"M8 18h13\"></path><path d=\"M3 6h.01\"></path><path d=\"M3 12h.01\"></path><path d=\"M3 18h.01\"></path></svg><span>发布要点</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>上线</strong> 10 月 17 日网页、App 和 API 切到 V4.1-Flash-1017。</li>\n<li><strong>定位</strong> 基准提升的同时缩短任务时间和输出长度。</li>\n<li><strong>成绩</strong> 文中称在多个 Harness 下走到新的性能–费用帕累托前沿，并开放自研搜索 API。</li>\n<li><strong>可用</strong> 建议把 DeepSeek Harness 升到 0.2.1-rc.1 及以上。单价和速度名次没有写。</li>\n</ul>\n<p class=\"info-card-note\">来源：<a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=Mzk0OTYwNzc3NQ==&mid=2247485876&idx=1&sn=2606d3fa9ac085f94290ddd1d94649cc\">DeepSeek V4.1 Flash 新版本</a></p>\n</aside>\n\n"
